OL,3,GNEWSADramatic SEC expansion plans
OL,4,Ainclude floating platform on the Clyde
OL,5,
OL,6,FOwners of Glasgow's SEC campus have
OL,7,Funveiled dramatic expansion plans,
OL,8,Fincluding designs for a new outdoor
OL,9,Fconcert venue and a floating platform
OL,10,Fon the Clyde.
OL,12,FThe proposals would turn about 64 acres
OL,13,Fof development land - which is mostly
OL,14,Fused for parking currently - into a
OL,15,F"new city quarter" with shops and bars.
OL,17,FOutdoor shows would be hosted in the
OL,18,Fspace directly behind the current SEC
OL,19,Fbuilding, if the plans are approved.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
