OL,3,GNEWSADramatic SEC expansion plans
OL,4,Ainclude floating platform on the Clyde
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe campus encompasses the OVO Hydro
OL,7,Fvenue which hosts concerts and major
OL,8,Fevents, the SEC Centre which is
OL,9,Fprimarily used for conferences, and the
OL,10,FSEC Armadillo for smaller concerts and
OL,11,Ftheatre shows.
